@baseUrl = http://localhost:4004/sample/Owners
@dummyAuth = Basic ZHVtbXk6ZHVtbXk=

### Listar todos os proprietários
GET {{baseUrl}}/Owners
Authorization: {{dummyAuth}}

### Buscar proprietário por ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/Owners(ID=81ffd7bc-8523-4d8e-8e27-db44959b2bea)
Authorization: {{dummyAuth}}

### Criar novo proprietário
POST {{baseUrl}}/Owners
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{dummyAuth}}

{
  "firstName": "Roberto",
  "lastName": "Oliveira",
  "phone": "11987654321",
  "email": "roberto.oliveira@email.com"
}

### Atualizar proprietário
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/Owners(id=233d8bd7-1794-4390-9bf1-a262762cb20d)
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: {{dummyAuth}}

{
  "phone": "11912345678"
}

### Remover proprietário
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/Owners(ID=a3846505-90ad-4b77-abaa-15d21588e4ff)
Authorization: {{dummyAuth}}

### Listar proprietários com pets expandidos
GET {{baseUrl}}/Owners?$expand=pets
Authorization: {{dummyAuth}}
